        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_yq-7AZHzM5kZ0ld8t5m-81" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- Qualitative data is combined with quantitative data to calculate results.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- FOMP = First order model process&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bdiv%20align%3D%26quot%3Bcenter%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BNotes%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%20align%3D%26quot%3Bcenter%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%20align%3D%26quot%3Bleft%26quot%3B%26gt%3B-%20All%20input%20data%20gets%20stored%20as%20parameters%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%20align%3D%26quot%3Bleft%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%20align%3D%26quot%3Bleft%26quot%3B%26gt%3B-%20Consistency_check()%20is%20an%20ODYM-inherent%20function%20that%20allows%20to%20confirm%20general%20system%20definition%20consistency%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22shape%3Dnote%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3BbackgroundOutline%3D1%3BdarkOpacity%3D0.05%3BfontSize%3D11%3Bsize%3D10%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%221490%22%20y%3D%2290%22%20width%3D%22170%22%20height%3D%22140%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- FOMP procedure is separated from ODYM procedure. After calculations, FOMP results are then used to calculate remaining non-FOMP F and S and all results are finally stored in the ODYM data base.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- MassBalance() is an ODYM function that checks if mass balance principle is fulfilled.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fontSize=11;size=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" parent="_yq-7AZHzM5kZ0ld8t5m-25" vertex="1">
